# ProClaim-eval, arm 1: the Verifier Agent (paper row 0.66).
#
# One prompt per claim: librarian retrieval, then a Sonnet verdict. It never
# imports ProClaim, so it needs none of ProClaim's stack and installs anywhere.
# `--only verifier` runs on this alone.
#
# Arm 2, the full ProClaim pipeline, is proclaim-pipeline.in.
-r _librarian.in

